sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant T as TUI
    participant B as BlastGuard
    participant SSH as ssh tunnel
    U->>T: /exit, /quit or Ctrl+C
    T->>B: leave alt-screen
    B->>U: print last report to stdout (stays in scrollback)
    B->>B: close DB connections
    B->>SSH: stop the tunnel (only if BlastGuard started it)
